# PG Hunter — environment
#
# The backend is Cloudflare Workers + D1. There are NO required frontend env
# vars anymore (the old PUBLIC_SUPABASE_* vars are gone).
#
# Backend configuration lives in:
#   - wrangler.toml     → D1 binding, site URL, deploy settings
#   - .dev.vars         → local secrets (copy from .dev.vars.example)
#   - wrangler secrets  → production secrets (see CLOUDFLARE_SETUP.md)
